Z||000000||Motorhead||04-25-2000||06:22 PM||||<P>Well, I'm still at it!  <BR>So far I've seen lots of folks who would like to be a part of a Carolina group, but I haven't gotten too much in the way of suggestions, or pictures and comments!<BR>I think we have a tentative trip to Williamsburg, VA for the show put on by Fiero Owners Club Of Southeastern Virginia.  At least turbo 86SE and myself are planning on attending.<BR>If any of you folks from the Carolinas would like to ride along, let either turbo86se or me know and we'll set up a meeting point to drive up together.  If your car isn't finished yet, don't let that stop you.  I'll probably end up going in the Honda Accord, but what the heck, at least we can get together.<BR>I've put together a quickie page to throw ideas around on. Visit at <A HREF="http://community.webtv.net/fxmup/CarolinaFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://community.webtv.net/fxmup/CarolinaFieros</A> <BR>All suggestions and assistance is always welcomed!<BR>Mike||||reg||1
